    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43588" root="&#xA;                        مسك&#xA;                    " body-key="m1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْكَةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Intelligence:</i> (Msb:) or <i>full intelligence,</i>
(K, TA,) <i>and judgment; judgment and intel-ligence to which one has recourse;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْكٌ</span>,
not ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسِيكٌ</span></b> , as in the K; (TA;) <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَاسُكٌ</span>.
(Mgh.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْسَ لَهُ مُسْكَةٌ</span>
                        <i>He has no intel-ligence.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَيْسَ بِهِ مُسْكَةٌ</span>
                        <i>He has no
strength.</i> (Msb.)

